For automating BGP neighbor setup on a Nokia (Alcatel-Lucent) 7750 SR when dealing with multiple external peers, you can use **BGP dynamic neighbors** or **peer templates**. Here are the approaches:

## Option 1: BGP Dynamic Neighbors (Recommended)

This allows the router to automatically establish sessions with any peer in specified ranges:

```
configure router bgp
    group "EXTERNAL_PEERS"
        type external
        dynamic-neighbor
            prefix <subnet/mask> [peer-as <AS-number> | peer-range <min-as>-<max-as>]
            exit
        exit
