Example:
```
configure router bgp
    group "DYNAMIC_ISP_PEERS"
        type external
        dynamic-neighbor
            prefix 192.0.2.0/24 peer-as 64500-65535
            prefix 203.0.113.16/28 peer-as 65001
            exit
        exit
```

## Option 2: Peer Templates

You can create a template and apply it to multiple neighbors:

```
configure router bgp
    peer-template "EXT_TEMPLATE"
        type external
        import "EXTERNAL_IN"
        export "EXTERNAL_OUT"
        peer-as 65000
    exit
    
    group "EXTERNAL_PEERS"
        neighbor 192.0.2.1
            use-peer-template "EXT_TEMPLATE"
        exit
        neighbor 192.0.2.2
            use-peer-template "EXT_TEMPLATE"
        exit
    exit
```

