- **Keepalive Interval**: The frequency (in seconds) at which keepalive messages are sent (`keepalive = hold_time / 3` by default).
- **BGP Negotiation**: Peers agree on the **minimum of their configured hold times** (e.g., if you set `hold-time 120` and the peer sets `60`, the negotiated hold time will be `60`).

