```bash
configure
    router "Base"
        bgp
            group "L2VPN-PEERS"
                neighbor "192.168.1.1"
                    graceful-restart
                        forwarding-flag-policy "GR-L2VPN-FORWARDING-STATE"  # Apply policy
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
```

#### **Option B: Using Import Policies (Alternative)**
If you prefer controlling the `forwarding-state` flag on import rather than export, use an import policy:

```bash
