If you must enforce this via a route policy (e.g., to selectively apply it), create one like this:

```bash
configure
    policy-options
        begin
        prefix-list "ALLOW_ALL" 
            prefix 0.0.0.0/0 longer
        exit
        policy-statement "KEEP_NH_AND_LABELS"
            entry 10
                from
                    prefix-list "ALLOW_ALL"
                exit
                action accept
                    next-hop original  # Preserves original next-hop
                    advertise-label true  # Ensures MPLS labels are included
                exit
            exit
        commit
```

