        begin
        community "MVPN_COMM"
            members "target:64512:100"
        exit
        policy-statement "MVPN-Policy"
            entry 10
                from protocol bgp-mvpn
                action accept
                    community add "MVPN_COMM"
                    ext-community 0x010b  # Force Type 0x01, Subtype 0x0B
                exit
            exit
        commit
```

### **4. Verify BGP Advertisements**
