Set a higher local preference for routes learned via your backup instance:

```nokia
configure router policy-options
    begin
    policy-statement SET_LPREF
        entry 10
            from protocol ospf3 instance <backup_instance_id>
            action accept
                preference <higher_value_than_default>
            exit
        exit
    commit
exit

