    prefix-list NEIGHBOR_A_IPS prefix <NEIGHBOR_IP>/32 exact
    policy-statement NO_BOUNCE_BACK
        entry 10
            from neighbor <NEIGHBOR_IP>
            action reject
        exit
    commit
exit
apply this policy to the mirror node’s BGP export.

---

