## Configuration Approach

### 1. Configure BGP Export Policy (for sending multiple paths)
```
A:SR7750>config>router>bgp# info
    group "VPNV4_PEERS"
        family vpn-ipv4
        peer-as <AS_NUMBER>
        neighbor <PEER_IP>
            export "MULTI_PATH_EXPORT"
