                    prefix-list "LOCAL_VPN_ROUTES"
                to
                    protocol bgp-vpn
                action accept
                exit
            exit
        commit
```

### 2. Configure BGP Import Policy (to block incoming paths)
```
A:SR7750>config>router>bgp# info
    group "VPNV4_PEERS"
        neighbor <PEER_IP>
            import "BLOCK_INCOMING_PATHS"
        exit
    exit
    policy-options
        begin
        policy-statement "BLOCK_INCOMING_PATHS"
            entry 10
                from
